CI summary split (ADR 0018): server owns Checks/status facts, Actions log condense+redact, schema validation, and HTML table cell rendering. The model only fills structured `headline` / `reason` / `fixHint` fields (`authorCiSummary.ts`). Server must overwrite model-drifted `status` and check names from GitHub facts. Ack, ticks, and publish render the cell from `pr_head_ci_state`. The projector patches the marked cell when `head` matches and `v` is newer. Do not let the model emit table markup.
